    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAirfield Manor is a small, gated development of only 8 apartments, tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac just off the Stillorgan Road within minutes' walk of Donnybrook Village. No 7 is a two bedroomed duplex presented in excellent order throughout and flooded with natural light. \n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises of entrance hall, superb bright and spacious open living/dining room with an attractive fireplace and flooring, the fitted kitchen is well equipped, two bedrooms (main bedroom en-suite) and bathroom completes the accommodation. The property has the bonus of a small storage shed and secure designated parking. \n\nSituated at the Donnybrook village end of the Stillorgan Road directly opposite RTE, the property enjoys an extremely convenient location with the extensive amenities of Donnybrook and Ballsbridge within walking distance including Merrion S.C, St. Vincent's Hospital, R.D.S, Riverview (David Lloyd) Tennis centre and Herbert Park. The extensive educational and recreational amenities of U.C.D Belfield are also within walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\n - \nACCOMMODATIONEntrance Hallway: bright and spacious with attractive flooring, ceiling coving and excellent understairs storage.Living/Dining Room: superb spacious reception room with attractive flooring, ceiling coving and a fireplace with open fire.Kitchen: with built in wall and floor presses, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan. Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. Tiled floor.Bedroom 1: bright and spacious double bedroom with built in wardrobes.Ensuite Shower Room: with corner shower cubicle, w.c. and wash hand basin. Part tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\n"
      },
